5% or more of the outstanding common stock were excluded as they may be deemed to be affiliates. This determination of affiliate status is not necessarily a conclusive determination for other purposes.\nL46: The number of outstanding shares of the registrant’s common stock as of October 2, 2026 was 1,131,423,212.\nL47: \nL48: DOCUMENTS INCORPORATED BY REFERENCE\nL49: Portions of the Proxy Statement for the registrant’s Fiscal 2026 Annual Meeting of Stockholders, to be filed within 120 days of the end of the fiscal year ended September 3, 2026, are incorporated by reference in Part III hereof. Except with respect to information specifically incorporated by reference in this Annual Report on Form 10-K, the Proxy Statement is not deemed to be filed as part hereof.\nL50: \nL51: * * *\nL52: \nL53: cite0†Image: micron-corporate-profile-letter-eng-093026.jpg L54: \nL55: * * *\nL56: cite1†Image: fnc-3044200-2025-10k-vmv.jpg L57: \nL58: * * *\nL59: \nL60: Table of Contents\nL61:  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\nL62:  |  |\nL63: cite2†Introduction | cite2†5 L64: cite3†PART I |\nL65: cite4†Item 1. | cite4†Business | cite4†7 L66: cite5†Item 1A. | cite5†Risk Factors | cite5†23 L67: cite6†Item 1B. | cite6†Unresolved Staff Comments | cite6†47 L68: cite7†Item 1C. | cite7†Cybersecurity | cite7†47 L69: cite8†Item 2 .  | cite8†Properties | cite8†49 L70: cite9†Item 3. | cite9†Legal Proceedings | cite9†51 L71: cite10†Item 4. | cite10†Mine Safety Disclosures | cite10†51 L72: cite11†PART II |\nL73: cite12†Item 5. | cite12†Market for Registrant’s Common Equity, Related Stockholder Matters, and Issuer Purchases of Equity Securities | cite12†52 L74: cite13†Item 6. | cite13†[Reserved] | cite13†54 L75: cite14†Item 7. | cite14†Management’s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations | cite14†55 L76: cite15†Item 7A. | cite15†Quantitative and Qualitative Disclosure